OL,3,GNEWSABoy died after 'acute' asthma
OL,4,Aattack - coroner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 12-year-old boy died due to "acute
OL,7,Fexacerbation of asthma" after
OL,8,Fcollapsing on a school field, a coroner
OL,9,Fhas ruled.
OL,11,FJoshua Lloyd, who was a pupil at
OL,12,FTelford Langley School, had been taking
OL,13,Fpart in a PE lesson in javelin-throwing
OL,14,Fat the time.
OL,16,FSchool staff and emergency services
OL,17,F"did all they could", coroner Heath
OL,18,FWesterman said, adding that Joshua's
OL,19,Fdeath on 16 June 2023 was "unexpected
OL,20,Fand unpreventable".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
