OL,3,GNEWSABoy died after 'acute' asthma
OL,4,Aattack - coroner
OL,5,
OL,6,FWesterman also extended his "sincere
OL,7,Fcondolences" and said his "heart goes
OL,8,Fout" to Joshua's parents Rebecca and
OL,9,FDavid Lloyd, who attended the inquest.
